# Vendored Third-Party Models
#
# This directory contains adapted implementations from external projects,
# integrated for use with APEBench-Online surrogate training.
#
# Included packages:
#
# - al4pde/: Active learning for PDEs
#   Source: https://github.com/divelab/AIRS/tree/main/OpenPDE/AL4PDE
#   License: MIT
#
# - pdearena/: PDE benchmarking models
#   Source: https://github.com/microsoft/pdearena
#   License: MIT (see pdearena/__init__.py)
#
# - scot/: Scalable Operator Transformer
#   Source: https://github.com/neuraloperator/neuraloperator
#   License: MIT
#
# These implementations have been modified to work with our training pipeline
# and physics conditioning interface.
